.PP
In this bundle: PIPELINE_ANATOMY.md (a full dissection of every tool and
stage, written so the pipeline could be rebuilt from it),
docs/pipeline_overview.svg (the same thing as one illustration, with PCGR
decomposed), PANELS.md (panel profiles), RNA.md (the RNA branch),
TESTING.md (the test suite), RNA_SCOPE.md and CNV_SCOPE.md (what is
deliberately not built), DATABASE_SETUP.md, install.md.
.PP
GATK documentation:
.UR https://gatk.broadinstitute.org
.UE .
COSMIC:
.UR https://cancer.sanger.ac.uk/cosmic
.UE .
.PP
.B install_pipeline.py
installs these scripts and everything they depend on, and
.B "install_pipeline.py \-\-update"
run from a newer copy of the bundle refreshes the scripts of an
already-installed machine without touching its databases or conda
environments;
.B \-\-check
reports whether they are behind. See
.I install.md
in the bundle.
.PP
Each script also carries a DEBUGGING NOTES section in its module docstring
covering behaviour that is easy to misread from the outside; run
.B "python3 <script> \-\-help"
for the authoritative option list.
